            "review_title": "Review at Green Hill Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mike B\n19 contributions\n0\nAmazing tasty food\nNov 2019 • Couples\nI had such a Good dishes Here. I came for Lunch with my gf. We had some noodlds with vegetables, pork and springrolls. Its the best which i eat Here in Hagiang.\nAnd such a great Coffee. My gf had a mango smoothie, she just told me that it was tasty. \n\nAfter Lunch er hangout a bit Here and planned our travel by the Mountains. \nLater the staff asked us, if we wanna join the family dinner. \nHell yeah! So we got a very nice hotpot.\n\nI just can recommend this place 😁 go Here and Enjoy your food\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2019",
